<title>USA: Belcor takes control of Rio Grande Mining.</title>
<headline>Belcor takes control of Rio Grande Mining.</headline>
<dateline>SONOMA, Calif. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belcor Inc said Tuesday it raised its stake in Rio Grande Mining Co to 80.74 percent from about 16 percent by acquiring shares in a stock swap with Coastal Capital Partners LP.</p>
<p>Belcor said Rio's principal asset is the Shafter/Presidio Project, located in Presidio County, Texas. It contains more than 30 million ounces of silver mineralized material, according to the most recent management estimate.</p>
